        {
          "user": "Rafael-SOWNet",
          "created_at": "2026-10-02T05:34:24Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-10-02T05:34:24Z",
          "body": "Recorded as [item 16 on #1019](https://github.com/asc-community/AngouriMath/issues/1019): `simp` \u2192 `simplify`, `fsimp` \u2192 `normalize`, `diff` \u2192 `differentiate`, `sub` \u2192 `substitute`, `info` \u2192 `describe`, `eval` \u2192 `evaluate`.\n\nTwo lines of the usage text are also wrong now: \"differentiates over VAR\" should be \"with respect to VAR\", and \"solves over VAR\" should be \"for VAR\". That's text only, so I'll fix it in 2.6.\n"
        }
